{"id":"n39913-2-7","stage":4,"title":"내오다 · 端出来","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n39913-2-7-1","ko":"손님 오셨다. 여기 과일 좀 내오너라.","zh":"有客人来了。快把这里的水果拿过来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"손님","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客。","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}},{"text":"오셨다.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오셨다","audio":"/audio/164c57289a4d05f72644.mp3"}},{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"과일","meaning":"水果","explanation":"과일：水果。","readings":[{"term":"과일","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18264","senseId":"1","lemma":"과일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"과일","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"내오너라.","meaning":"端出来","explanation":"내오다：端出来；너라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"내오다","audio":"/audio/b2b0324f99f7ff0cdd82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"39913","senseId":"2","lemma":"내오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내오너라","audio":"/audio/93784f61be022d9c636b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"ed0e90733d1a21cf","term":"과일","zh":"水果","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3","entryId":"18264","definition":"苹果、梨、葡萄、栗子等主要长在树上的，人们可以食用的果子。","pronunciation":["과ː일"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"b2b0324f99f7ff0c","term":"내오다","zh":"端出来","audio":"/audio/b2b0324f99f7ff0cdd82.mp3","entryId":"39913","definition":"准备食物后拿过来。","pronunciation":["내ː오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/579a1d1f0e37094544f0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n39913-2-7-2","ko":"사과랑 배를 깎아 올게요.","zh":"我这就把苹果和梨削好拿过来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사과랑","meaning":"苹果","explanation":"사과：苹果；랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"사과","audio":"/audio/46fc35121d1a4b332863.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66371","senseId":"1","lemma":"사과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사과랑","audio":"/audio/48467b109cf45d9c7afb.mp3"}},{"text":"배를","meaning":"梨","explanation":"배：梨；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31454","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배를","audio":"/audio/8d62500623ac2523536a.mp3"}},{"text":"깎아","meaning":"削","explanation":"깎다：削；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"깎다","audio":"/audio/18d35